      "title": "Hakurei Reimu",
      "excerpt": "Her hair color is usually brown or black and her eye colors vary between red, black, or brown. Her signature accessories are a frilled red hair bow, frilled hair tubes on her sidelocks, and a yellow ascot. Her outfit is a sleeveless red shirt with frilled collar, detached white sleeves, matching frilled red skirt, white socks, and brown loafers or black Mary Janes.",
